Third-party notices for @mermaid-js/plugin-hand-drawn
=====================================================

roughjs
-------

This package depends on roughjs 4.6.6 (https://github.com/rough-stuff/rough), installed from npm
as a runtime dependency. No roughjs code is copied into this package; `src/sketch.ts` calls the
DOM-free `RoughGenerator` and writes its drawing ops through @mermaid-js/core's `PathBuilder`.
roughjs in turn depends on hachure-fill, path-data-parser, points-on-curve and points-on-path,
by the same author and under the same license.

